{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40514","headline":"猎犬行 · 苏拯","name":"猎犬行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猎犬未成行，狐兔无奈何。\n猎犬今盈羣，狐兔依旧多。\n自尔初跳跃，人言多拏躩。\n常指天外狼，立可口中嚼。\n骨长毛衣重，烧残烟草薄。\n狡兔何曾擒，时把家鸡捉。\n食尽者饭翻，增养者恶壮。\n可嗟猎犬壮复壮，不堪兔绝良弓丧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏拯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}